    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the airborne workshop of the late Inventor-General Archimedes Vance. Suspended miles above the smog-choked streets of New London in a decaying dirigible, this laboratory holds his greatest secret: the blueprints for an infinite clean energy engine, locked safely away inside The Brass Vault. As the airship's boiler pressure drops to critical levels, you have only a limited time to navigate his labyrinth of steam-powered contraptions and clockwork terminals. You must decipher the intricate connections between his aetheric inventions and restore the grand mechanism before the vessel plummets to the earth.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
